      «type: X»
      «description: Integrator (z-domain) - 0=trap ; 1=backward; 2=forward»
      «library file: |.subckt Integrator-z u0 CLK y0\nVdd Vdd 0 RNG\nVss Vss 0 -RNG\n¥1 Vdd Vss u1 ¥ u0 CLK Vdd ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ LATCH IC=RNG REF=0.5+RNG TTOL=TTOL\n¥2 Vdd Vss y1 ¥ y0 CLK Vdd ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ LATCH IC=RNG REF=0.5+RNG TTOL=TTOL\n¥3 Vdd Vss t0 ¥ N01 CLK Vdd ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ LATCH IC=RNG REF=0.5+RNG TTOL=TTOL\n¥4 Vdd Vss t1 ¥ t0 CLK Vdd ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ LATCH IC=RNG REF=0.5+RNG TTOL=TTOL\nB1 N01 0 V=time\nB2 Ts 0 V=V(t0)-V(t1)\nB3 y0 0 V=if(algorithm==0, V(y1)+V(Ts)/2*(V(u0)+V(u1)), if(algorithm==1, V(y1)+V(Ts)*V(u0), V(y1)+V(Ts)*V(u1)) )\n.ends Integrator-z»
